{"4301380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mega Roids", "steam_appid": 4301380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEGA ROIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A frantic first-person retro arcade shooter where the asteroids you blast create the chaos you have to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Jack, the newest contractor for the ACME Space Mining Company. The pay is too good to be true: a cut of every asteroid core you recover. Your first shift drops you into a sealed ACME Hyper-Toroidal Space Bubble in an unfamiliar NESDA Mining Spacecraft 4000x — and the alien raider known as the Head wants those cores back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE ESCALATING STAGES, ONE CONTINUOUS LOOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives and score carry across every stage. Clear all three and the loop restarts — harder, faster, deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 1 — Roid Blaster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam a wrap-around asteroid field and crack rocks open for treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off green and blue alien raiders that hunt your loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your engine heat — push too hard and you'll overheat and stall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the portal and punch through to the next stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 2 — Roid Run</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A white-knuckle first-person canyon flight where one wall is instant death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast wall, rim, and mid-wall turrets and grab high-value orb targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thread the exit portal at speed — or start the run over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 3 — Mega Roids</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit the massive alien Head and shatter its rotating 80-panel shield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch missiles through the gaps to hammer the Head itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge charged eye missiles and a barrage of spat asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure score attack</strong> — bonus life every 5,000 points, score cap 999,999,999.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> — climb to the top and defend your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> to chase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> plus keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Native Windows &amp; Linux builds</strong> (Steam Deck playable).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Sharing</strong> supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free demo</strong> — try Stage 1 before you buy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLAST. LOOP. BEAT THE HEAD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack the roids, claim the cores, survive the raiders, and make it out with your cut of the profits.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEGA ROIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A frantic first-person retro arcade shooter where the asteroids you blast create the chaos you have to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Jack, the newest contractor for the ACME Space Mining Company. The pay is too good to be true: a cut of every asteroid core you recover. Your first shift drops you into a sealed ACME Hyper-Toroidal Space Bubble in an unfamiliar NESDA Mining Spacecraft 4000x — and the alien raider known as the Head wants those cores back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE ESCALATING STAGES, ONE CONTINUOUS LOOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives and score carry across every stage. Clear all three and the loop restarts — harder, faster, deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 1 — Roid Blaster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam a wrap-around asteroid field and crack rocks open for treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off green and blue alien raiders that hunt your loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your engine heat — push too hard and you'll overheat and stall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the portal and punch through to the next stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 2 — Roid Run</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A white-knuckle first-person canyon flight where one wall is instant death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast wall, rim, and mid-wall turrets and grab high-value orb targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thread the exit portal at speed — or start the run over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stage 3 — Mega Roids</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit the massive alien Head and shatter its rotating 80-panel shield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch missiles through the gaps to hammer the Head itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge charged eye missiles and a barrage of spat asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure score attack</strong> — bonus life every 5,000 points, score cap 999,999,999.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> — climb to the top and defend your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> to chase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> plus keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Native Windows &amp; Linux builds</strong> (Steam Deck playable).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Sharing</strong> supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free demo</strong> — try Stage 1 before you buy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLAST. LOOP. BEAT THE HEAD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack the roids, claim the cores, survive the raiders, and make it out with your cut of the profits.</p>", "short_description": "Blast open asteroid fields, grab the loot, and survive the chaos you create in this fast-paced first-person retro arcade shooter. Crack asteroids for treasure, fend off alien raiders, fly the canyon, and topple the alien Head across three escalating stages.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301380/0f805904be7a018bcc6b3a1a674efc123ac9a5e6/header.jpg?t=1786735854", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301380/469102f5b735faa3ec8731e4578ac320b5a8ce4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786735854", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301380/469102f5b735faa3ec8731e4578ac320b5a8ce4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786735854", "website": "https://psd-labs.net/mega-roids", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b